The origin of the OpenSVC AI agent, such as https://ai.example.com:8090,
which om3-webapp calls for its assistant. Set it in the cluster
configuration. It is an https origin only, the scheme, the host and the port:
another value is refused when written.

om3-webapp reads it from the cluster status, once signed in, and calls the
agent directly from the browser. The agent is therefore reached by the
browsers of the users, and allows the origin of the webapp of this cluster
in its CORS configuration. The browsers verify its certificate: one a
private CA signed requires that CA to be trusted on the workstations of the
users, as no om3 setting turns the verification off.

The assistant is offered to the users signed in with OpenID, the only
tokens the agent takes. Empty, om3-webapp offers no assistant.
